{title: Ishq Bulaava}
{artist: Sanam Hasee Toh Phasee}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
Ishq bulaa [Am]va, jaane kab aav [G]e,        Ishq bula [Am]ava, aave jab aav [G]e
Main ta [Am]kol tere rehna,        Main ta [G]kol tere rehna
[Am]Main ta [G]baitha kol tere,        Tainu tak [Em]da rawaan
[Em]Baaton pe teri, [D]hansda rawaan,        [D]Pagal main khud nu [Am]bananda rawaan
[Am]Tu hansdi rawe mai [D]hansanda rawaan,        Tainu [G]takda rawaan
[Am]Haan ...        [D]Haaan.. ...
[A]Haan........        [C]Haaan .......
Tenu [D]takda [Em]rawaan,        Ajeeb [Em]rangaan di, tu hai [C]badi
Lage [D]alag hi, jahaan [Am]di ..        Ajeeb [Em]rangaan di, tu hai [C]badi
Lage [D]alag hi, jahaan [Am]di ..        [Am]Ae to nazraan naz [D]raan di gal [G]ve
[Am]Tu vi [G]sun le [Am]zara,        Main ta [Am]Kol tere rehna
Main ta [G]kol tere rehna,        [Am]Main ta [G]rehna kol tere?
Tainu tak [Em]da rawaan,        [Em]Baaton pe teri, [D]hansda rawaan
[D]Pagal main khud nu, [Am]bananda rawaan,        [Am]Tu hansdi rawe, main [D]hansanda rawaan
Tainu [G]takda rawaan,        [Am]Naina che tere main va [G]sdi rawaan
[G]Paagal main khud nu ban [Am]anda rawaan,        [Am]Tu hansdi rawe mai ha [G]nsanda rawaan
Tainu [C]takda rawaan
